<h1>MERCHANT SERVICES AGREEMENT</h1>
<h2>Specific Terms</h2>

<p>
THIS MERCHANT SERVICES AGREEMENT - Specific Terms (&ldquo;STC&rdquo;) is made on
<strong><apex:outputText value="{0,date,MMMM d, yyyy}"><apex:param value="{!compliance.MSA_Effective_Date__c}"/></apex:outputText></strong>
the date it is signed by both Parties (&quot;Effective Date&quot;) between
Nuvei Limited, incorporated and registered in Cyprus with company number HE129880
whose registered office is at 9 Kafkasou, Aglantzia, CY 2112, Nicosia, Cyprus
(&ldquo;Nuvei&rdquo;) and
<strong>{!compliance.Name}</strong>
incorporated and registered in
<strong>{!compliance.Registered_Country__c}</strong>
with registration number
<strong>{!compliance.Incorporation_number__c}</strong>
whose registered office is at
<strong>{!compliance.Registered_Address_New__c}</strong>
(the &ldquo;Client&rdquo;). Each a &ldquo;Party&rdquo; and collectively the &ldquo;Parties&rdquo;.
</p>

<p>The Client has requested Nuvei to supply the Services (as defined below) and Nuvei has agreed to supply the Services, on the terms set out in the Agreement (as defined below).</p>

<p>In consideration of the mutual promises, covenants, undertakings, understandings and agreements set out in the Agreement, Nuvei and the Client agree as follows:</p>

<h3>1. The Agreement</h3>
<p class="subclause">1.1. This Merchant Services Agreement &ndash; STC is subject to and is governed by the general terms and conditions available at: https://www.nuvei.com/service-pages/msa-gtc-limited (the &ldquo;GTC&rdquo;) which are specifically incorporated herein by this reference and made part of this Agreement.</p>
<p class="subclause">1.2. Following the signature of this Merchant Services Agreement &ndash; STC by both Parties, a countersigned copy of it, together with a copy of the GTC will be sent to the Client via email. Such copy of the GTC sent by Nuvei, together with the countersigned copy of this Merchant Services Agreement - STC and any Schedules and other documents referenced in it or in the GTC, constitute the binding agreement between the Parties concerning this subject matter (jointly the &ldquo;Agreement&rdquo;). The Parties acknowledge that they have had the opportunity to review and agree to be bound by the terms and provisions of the Agreement.</p>
<p class="subclause">1.3. Definitions and Interpretation. Unless the context otherwise requires, capitalized words and expressions used herein shall have the meaning given to them in the GTC or its Schedules and shall be interpreted accordingly.</p>
<p class="subclause">&ldquo;C-Panel&rdquo; means Nuvei&rsquo;s client back-office portal, through which Nuvei makes available to the Client, free of charge, the information relating to the Transactions.</p>

<h3>2. Supply of Services</h3>
<p class="subclause">2.1. In consideration of the Fees (as defined below) and subject to the Client&rsquo;s continued compliance with the provisions of the Agreement, Nuvei shall provide the Client with, and the Client accepts, the following Services:</p>
<p class="subclause">(i) acquiring and processing of the Transactions and Remittance as detailed and subject to the terms and conditions of Schedule 2 - Processing Services under the GTC;</p>
<p class="subclause">(ii) additional services all as detailed in Appendix A herein and in subsequent offerings; and</p>
<p class="subclause">(iii) any additional Services or products made available by Nuvei, as shall be mutually agreed by the Client and Nuvei from time to time;</p>
<p class="subclause">(iv) subject to clause 6.2, access to the C-Panel forming part of the Platform.</p>
<p class="subclause">(jointly and severally, the &ldquo;Services&rdquo;)</p>
<p class="subclause">2.2. Nuvei shall provide the Services strictly to the Client and only the Client has the right to use them.</p>
<p class="subclause">2.3. Subject to the provisions of this Agreement, Applicable Laws and/or Rules, the Remittances shall be made <strong>{!compliance.Remittance_Cycle_MSA_wording__c}</strong>. Payments shall be made to a bank account designated by the Client which Nuvei may credit with Remittances or debit as the case may be.</p>

<h3>3. Fees</h3>
<p>As a condition to receiving the Services, the Client shall pay Nuvei the fees set out in Appendix A herein and in accordance with the terms and conditions of the Agreement (&quot;Fees&quot;).</p>

<h3>4. Client websites</h3>
<p class="subclause">4.1. In the Agreement, &ldquo;Websites&rdquo; means jointly and severally the Client&rsquo;s wholly owned and operated URLs, websites and applications through which Transactions will be processed in connection with the Services.</p>
<p class="subclause">4.2. The Client represents and warrants that it shall only permit Transactions originated from a Website which is listed under clause 4.3 below or has been approved in advance and in writing by Nuvei. Client undertakes further to fully comply with the provisions of Schedule 3 - Client Declaration with respect to Websites under the GTC.</p>
<p class="subclause">4.3. List of Websites (please include ALL URLs including those disclosed in previous statements):</p>

<table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin-top:6pt;">
  <apex:repeat value="{!websites}" var="w">
    <tr class="website-row"><td>{!w.Name}</td></tr>
  </apex:repeat>
</table>

<h3>5. Term and Termination</h3>
<p>The Agreement shall commence on the Effective Date and shall continue in force until terminated in accordance with the provisions of the Agreement.</p>

<h3>6. Miscellaneous Provisions</h3>
<p class="subclause">6.1. Counterparts. This document may be executed in any number of counterparts, each of which shall constitute a duplicate original, but all the counterparts shall together constitute the one agreement.</p>
<p class="subclause">6.2. C-Panel Form. The Client shall have access to and use of the C-Panel upon submitting to Nuvei the filled C-Panel form attached as Appendix B herein.</p>
<p class="subclause">6.3. Governing Law and Jurisdiction. This Agreement and all matters (including any dispute relating to the existence, validity or termination of this Agreement or any contractual or non-contractual obligation) arising from it shall be governed by, and construed in accordance with, English law. English court shall have exclusive jurisdiction to settle any dispute or claim (including non-contractual disputes or claims) arising out of or in connection with this Agreement, its subject matter or formation.</p>

<p style="margin-top:18pt;">IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the Parties have caused the Agreement to be executed by their duly authorized officers as of the day and year first above written.</p>

