<h2 style="margin-top:0;">Appendix A to Merchant Services Agreement-STC</h2>
<h1 style="font-size:12pt; margin-bottom:14pt;">FEES</h1>

<h3>A. Minimum commitments</h3>
<p>The Client undertakes to comply with the following obligations and commitments as of the date the Client can process Transactions in production (the &ldquo;Go Live Date&rdquo;):</p>

<p class="subclause">1. <strong>Minimum Monthly Fee</strong> - Commission and/or Acquiring Margin (as applicable) and processing fees (in the aggregate) (together, the &lsquo;Aggregated Fees&rsquo;) shall exceed: <strong>{!compliance.Minimum_Fee_SC_ACQIURER_MSA_section__c}</strong> (the &lsquo;Minimum Monthly Fee&rsquo;). It has been agreed that the Aggregated Fees actually accrued in an applicable calendar month shall be calculated against the Client&rsquo;s processing with the Nuvei group (where similar agreements have been signed with such group members) and not only under this Agreement. In calendar months in which the Minimum Monthly Fee has not been met, Nuvei shall be eligible to charge and the Client shall pay Nuvei the delta between the actual Aggregated Fees due for that calendar month and the Minimum Monthly Fee.</p>

<p class="subclause">2. <strong>Minimum Period</strong> &ndash; The minimum term of the Agreement, in which the Client will process with Nuvei is a period of <strong><apex:outputText value="{0,number,#0}"><apex:param value="{!compliance.Contract_Term__c}"/></apex:outputText></strong> consecutive months as of the Go Live Date (Minimum Period). Should the Agreement terminate or expire for any reason during the Minimum Period, Nuvei shall be eligible to charge and the Client shall pay Nuvei an early termination fee, which shall be calculated by the multiplication of <strong>{!compliance.Fees_Currency__c} {!compliance.Minimum_commitment_calculation__c}</strong> times the number of months remaining in the Minimum Period.</p>

<p class="subclause">3. The Parties acknowledge and agree that the provision of Services by Nuvei and the respective fees have been calculated and agreed to by Nuvei on the basis of the Client&rsquo;s aforementioned obligations.</p>

<h3>B. Payment Processing Fees</h3>
<h4>1. Cards.</h4>

<apex:repeat value="{!merchantBanks}" var="b" >
<p style="margin-top:8pt;"><strong>1.1. {!b.Bank_Name_for_Conga__c}.</strong> {!b.New_MSA_wording__c}</p>
<p><em>Table 1.1.:</em></p>
<table class="fees">
