<h4>2. Alternative payment methods.</h4>
<p>Nuvei makes available to its clients an online &ldquo;APM Pricing Manager&rdquo; which requires a separate signing up and signing in. Through the APM Pricing Manager, Client in coordination with its liaison in Nuvei will manage Client&rsquo;s selection of APMs and their respective fees and terms. Subsequent changes and/or additions of APMs pricing and terms, would also be managed through the APM Pricing Manager unless otherwise advised by Nuvei.</p>
<p>For the avoidance of doubt, in addition to Client&rsquo;s confirmation of an APM and its specified pricing and terms, processing of said APM is also subject to further configuration and activation by Nuvei.</p>
<p><strong>Notes:</strong></p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Holdback rate for APMs - {!compliance.Holdback_rate_for_APMs_for_PQ_MSA__c}</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Adding any of the above payment methods may be subject to the alternative payment method approval.</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Chargeback handling fee for Alternative Payment Methods - {!compliance.APM_Chargeback_Fee__c}</p>

<h4>3. Gateway Only Services.</h4>
<p>The following Fees and terms shall apply to the transmission of Transactions via Nuvei Gateway (non acquiring).</p>
<p>Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in the Agreement (including but not limited to the definition of &lsquo;Services&rsquo; or the provisions of Schedule 2 of the Agreement), Gateway Only Services provided under this item: (i) relate to the Acquirers, APMs, Cards and Card Schemes specifically acknowledged by Nuvei in writing as supported and falling herein (said list may change from time to time and Nuvei&rsquo;s discretion); (ii) are limited to Nuvei enabling a straight through technical connectivity by receiving Transactions from Client and communicating them to the supported Acquirers and APMs as requested by Client; (iii) do not and are not intended to include any related services (including but not limited to risk related services, reconciliation, settlement, tokenization or otherwise) as these shall be described and/or priced separately; and (iv) are subject at all times to Client securing and maintaining direct business relationships and MIDs with such Acquirers or APMs, said business relationships shall remain strictly between Client and the respective Acquirers and APM.</p>
<p>For the avoidance of doubt: (i) pricing below is specific to the Nuvei service and is not meant to include or address fees and rates as agreed between Client and the respective Acquirers and APMs; (ii) the acquiring or aggregation of funds and/or the settlement or remittance of funds to or from the Client will be provided by the indicated Acquirer or APMP at their sole discretion and responsibility and not by Nuvei; and (iii) this section shall not apply to Acquirers and APMs which are the title of or are detailed in other engagements between the parties (e.g. in other payment schedules or sections).</p>
<p>Rates for Nuvei&rsquo;s Gateway Only Services are as described below:</p>
<table class="fees">
  <tr><td class="label"><strong>Gateway only Service</strong></td><td class="value"><strong>Processing Fee</strong></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Payment Gateway Service</td><td class="value">{!compliance.GW_Processing_Fee__c}</td></tr>
</table>

<p><strong>Notes to Part B:</strong></p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Wire fee - {!compliance.Wire_Fee__c}, above cost</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Where a Fee is scaled, rates for each scale reached shall only apply to the volumes processed within that scale for the specific payment method (i.e. progressive).</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Chargeback and fraud related fees. Chargeback handling fees do not include Card Scheme respective charges. Additionally, for each month in which the Client has exceeded the Chargeback Ratios and/or Fraud Ratios, the Client will be charged by Nuvei an additional fee of 0.5% (half a percent) of the Client&rsquo;s overall processing volume during the 3 preceding months.</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Nuvei, Card Schemes, Acquirers and/or APMPs may apply additional charges including ad hoc and/or periodical registration and/or set-up fees (applicable to Nuvei and/or the Client) or may change the then current charges and fees. Such charges and fees to be considered and affect the then current Fees and shall apply to the Client in the form, amounts and as of the date such institution(s) and/or Nuvei indicates. Nuvei is under no obligation to notify Client of Card Scheme, Acquirer and/or APM charges and fees or changes thereto.</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Processing fees are calculated per attempt for all Transaction types.</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Unless otherwise noted, all fees (for all Transaction types) will be charged in {!compliance.Fees_Currency__c} (&ldquo;Default Currency&rdquo;). For other processing currencies, fees will be charged in the Default Currency and converted into the specific processing currency. Where applicable, for &lsquo;gateway only&rsquo; services and fees that are not dependent on processing (e.g. fixed amounts), fees will be charged in the Default Currency.</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Remittances will be due and payable in {!remittanceCurrencyDisplay}. When processing is in other currencies, the respective banks&rsquo; and payment methods&rsquo; (Card Scheme, Acquirer, APM and/or otherwise) and Nuvei&rsquo;s prevailing conversion rates and fees will apply to each Transaction type.</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; For services which include or require currency conversion (e.g. dynamic currency convertor), Nuvei&rsquo;s prevailing conversion rates and fees will apply.</p>

<h3>C. Additional Services</h3>
<p>Below are the lists of the additional services currently available to the Client:</p>
<p style="margin-top:8pt;"><strong>ADDED VALUE SERVICES</strong></p>
<table class="fees">
  <tr><td class="label"><strong>Service</strong></td><td class="value"><strong>Fee</strong></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Standard Risk Services:<br/>&bull; Fraud screening Rules Engine<br/>&bull; Case Management System<br/>&bull; Automated Blacklist<br/>&bull; Daily Summary Alert<br/>&bull; Risk Support</td><td class="value">Rate per Transaction &ndash; included in the Processing Fee set forth above</td></tr>
