  <tr><td class="label">Card Tokenization</td><td class="value">Rate per Transaction &ndash; included in the Processing Fee set forth above.<br/>Recurring Fee &ndash; <apex:outputText value="{0,number,#0}"><apex:param value="{!compliance.Tokenization_recurring__c}"/></apex:outputText> Yearly</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Cashier/Payment Page Fee</td><td class="value">{!compliance.Cashier_fee__c} per Transaction</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Smart 3D Secure:<br/>&bull; Merchant Plug In (MPI) for cardholder authentication via schemes networks<br/>&bull; Routing between 3DS and Non-3DS routes<br/>&bull; Exemptions management rules engine<br/>&bull; Transaction risk analysis<br/>&bull; Reports</td><td class="value">{!compliance.Smart_3D_Secure_Fee__c}* per Transaction</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">3D Transactions fee (commission pricing only)</td><td class="value">{!compliance.X3D_Transactions_Fee__c} per Transaction</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Dynamic Currency Conversion (DCC)</td><td class="value">For currencies and as of dates the Parties mutually agree upon. Client is eligible to {!compliance.DCC__c}% from the foreign exchange rate applied on end user by Nuvei (above cost) to the sale Transaction. To be paid monthly in the form of a credit</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Mastercard Name Validation Service &amp; Visa Account Name Inquiry (ANI)</td><td class="value">{!compliance.Visa_Account_Name_Inquiry_ANI__c}* per check</td></tr>
  <apex:repeat value="{!chargebackProtections}" var="cb">
  <tr><td class="label">{!cb.MSA_Name__c}</td><td class="value">MC Notification fee - Pass through cost<br/>Refund request fee - {!cb.Success_Fee__c} (above cost)<br/>Set-up Fee &ndash; {!cb.Setup_Fee__c}</td></tr>
  </apex:repeat>
</table>
<p class="small"><em>* In addition to applicable Card Scheme and Card Issuer fees. Rates are progressive.</em></p>

<p style="margin-top:14pt;"><strong>Matching and Reconciliation Services</strong></p>
<table class="fees">
  <tr><td class="label"><strong>Service</strong></td><td class="value"><strong>Fee</strong></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Daily Payment method and PSP technical Transaction Matching</td><td class="value">0.20 per Transaction.<br/>Min. Monthly 5,000<br/>Max. Monthly 20,000<br/><br/>(to be calculated against the Client&rsquo;s processing with the Safecharge group (where similar agreements have been signed with such group members) and not only under this Agreement).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Monthly/Weekly Reconciliation Cycle</td><td class="value">&nbsp;</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Monitoring the Client&rsquo;s accounts for funds required for daily activity (optional)</td><td class="value">&nbsp;</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Monthly/Weekly summary</td><td class="value">&nbsp;</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Weekly balance monitoring</td><td class="value">&nbsp;</td></tr>
</table>

<p><strong>Notes to Part C:</strong></p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Nuvei may offer additional services from time to time, such services once ordered shall be deemed to be included in this Schedule 1 and unless specifically indicated otherwise by Nuvei shall be subject to the provisions of this Agreement and the respective service&rsquo; terms and conditions.</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Chargeback Representment Service - In certain cases the Client may purchase from Nuvei representation services for the purpose of appealing certain chargebacks. This fee is in addition to chargeback charges/handling fees/other periodical and/or ad hoc Scheme fees and relevant charges. The Client agrees to assist Nuvei when requested, at the Client&rsquo;s expense, to investigate any of the respective Transactions. It shall remain the Client&rsquo;s responsibility to prove to the reasonable satisfaction of the relevant Card Scheme, Acquirers or APMPs that the charge of an End User&rsquo;s account was authorized by such End User. Nuvei shall bear no responsibility or liability as to the Card Scheme, Acquirers or APMPs performance or decisions in such matters. Following such efforts any decision or determination of the relevant Acquirers or APMPs as to the validity and extent of any Chargeback shall be final and binding.</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Unless otherwise noted, all fees (for all Transaction types) will be charged in {!compliance.Fees_Currency__c} (&ldquo;Default Currency&rdquo;). For other processing currencies, fees will be charged in the Default Currency and converted into the specific processing currency.</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; The aforementioned services are designed to support the Client&rsquo;s decision making activities in the services&rsquo; respective domain(s). This is always subject to the adequacy of the information/documentation provided to Nuvei. The services&rsquo; recommendation may not be viewed or relied upon as a legal opinion or as a guaranty or warranty to the authenticity or legality of the submitted information/documentation. The Client is always advised to review the results and apply proper discretion.</p>
<p class="subclause">&bull; Any professional Services (for example purposes only: Special feature development), new Services or integrations which are not part of the scope of the Agreement shall be provided and charged based on an agreed Statement of Work (SOW) at the rate of 150 Euro per hour.</p>

