<p>Access to the Nuvei Control Panel is offered to Merchants as part and subject to the business relations and the provisions of the agreement(s) in place between Merchant and certain Nuvei entity or entities (jointly and severally: &ldquo;Agreements&rdquo;). The Merchant hereby requests, as part and subject to the provisions of the Agreements, that Nuvei enables it access to the Nuvei online reporting system (&ldquo;Nuvei Control Panel&rdquo;).</p>
<p>For that purpose, the Merchant hereby, subject to the conditions and with the permissions as detailed below, appoints the following roles:</p>

