<p>The Merchant hereby authorises {!resellerName} (&quot;Partner&quot;), as the Merchant&rsquo;s introducing partner, to access and manage the Merchant&rsquo;s Nuvei Control Panel account with Administrator permissions as defined in the Administrator section above. The Partner is granted full access/action permission to the Merchant&rsquo;s account(s) on Nuvei&rsquo;s Control Panel with the exception of the APM Pricing Management Section.</p>
<p>The Partner may appoint additional Authorized Users to the Nuvei Control Panel and set/change permissions to such Authorized Users. Such permission explicitly excludes appointment of or setting/changing permission to the APM Pricing Manager Section. The Partner is authorised to define, allocate, and manage the access of Authorized Users to the Nuvei Control Panel on behalf of the Merchant, including role management, requesting password re-allocation, granting a shared login, etc.</p>
<p>The Merchant specifically authorises the Partner to appoint Authorized Users with Administrator Permissions, same as the initial Administrator, without the need for Merchant approval. Merchant is fully aware of the scope and potential consequences of such permission.</p>
<p class="small"><strong>WARNING:</strong> You are about to grant the selected Partner extensive rights and permissions. Users with Admin Login permissions have access to sensitive account keys and account credentials (for example, secret keys which can be used in API requests and authentications on behalf of your company) as well as perform sensitive actions (such as IP whitelisting, Event API configuration, changing Team permissions and creating additional users with Admin permissions).</p>
